 thanks, agreement and gentle happiness.","parameters":[{"parameter":"ParamMouthForm","value":1,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowLY","value":0.25,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRY","value":0.25,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamCheek","value":0.4,"blend":"add"}]},{"id":"laugh","description":"Laughing, eyes shut and mouth open: delighted, amused. For jokes, playfulness and big joy.","parameters":[{"parameter":"ParamEyeLOpen","value":0,"blend":"multiply"},{"parameter":"ParamEyeROpen","value":0,"blend":"multiply"},{"parameter":"ParamMouthForm","value":1,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamMouthOpenY","value":0.8,"blend":"overwrite"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowLY","value":0.4,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRY","value":0.4,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamCheek","value":0.65,"blend":"add"}]},{"id":"angry","description":"Angry or annoyed, frowning. For irritation, frustration, indignation or scolding.","parameters":[{"parameter":"ParamBrowLY","value":-0.5,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRY","value":-0.5,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowLAngle","value":0.8,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRAngle","value":-0.8,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamMouthForm","value":-0.9,"blend":"add"}]},{"id":"sad","description":"Sad or disappointed, downcast. For sorrow, regret, apology or sympathy.","parameters":[{"parameter":"ParamBrowLY","value":0.35,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRY","value":0.35,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowLAngle","value":-0.8,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRAngle","value":0.8,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamMouthForm","value":-0.8,"blend":"add"}]},{"id":"surprised","description":"Surprised, mouth dropped open: startled, amazed. For shock, sudden news or disbelief.","parameters":[{"parameter":"ParamBrowLY","value":0.8,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamBrowRY","value":0.8,"blend":"add"},{"parameter":"ParamMouthOpenY","value":0.9,"blend":"overwrite"}]},{"id":"shy","description":"Shy or embarrassed: bashful, flustered.